<h3><strong>History</strong></h3>
<h3><em><strong>Medical:</strong></em></h3>
<ul><li>Pyrexia.</li><li>Systemic disease,</li><li>DM, SLE.</li><li>Genetic</li><li>Klinefelter.</li><li>Cystic fibrosis</li></ul>
<h3><em><strong>Surgical:</strong></em></h3>
<ul><li>Undescended</li><li>Testes.</li><li>Hernia repair.</li><li>Testicular trauma</li><li>torsion.</li><li><em><strong>Standing positionStanding position</strong></em>Standing positionStanding positionPelvic, bladder,</li><li>Retroperitoneal</li><li>Surgery.</li></ul>
<h3><em><strong>Sexual history:</strong></em></h3>
<ul><li>Erection/ejaculation</li><li>Frequency of</li><li>Intercourse.</li></ul>
<h3><em><strong>Medicine:</strong></em></h3>
<ul><li>Nitrofurantoin – Methotrexate</li><li>Cimetidine – colchicine</li><li>Spironolactone – amiodarone</li><li>Sulfasalazine – Antidepressants.</li><li>Phenothiazine’s.</li><li>alpha – Blockers, chemotherapy.</li></ul>
<h3><em><strong>Social history:</strong></em></h3>
<ul><li>Alcohol, drugs.</li><li>Smoking.</li><li>Ionizing radiation.</li><li>Chronic heat.</li><li>aniline dye Pesticide.</li><li>Lead exposure.</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Treatment:</strong></h3>
<ul><li><strong>Medical:</strong></li><li>CAH.</li><li>Hypogonadotropic – hypogonadism.</li><li>Hyperprolactinemia.</li><li>GnRH A or Gonadotrophins.</li><li>No role in idiopathic.</li><li><strong>surgical:</strong></li><li>Reversal of vasectomy – early rather than late.</li><li>Delayed reversal More failure due to anti Sperm Ab.</li><li>Varicocelectomy: Not for fertility treatment.</li><li>Sperm Retrieval:</li><li>Testes</li><li>TESA</li><li>TESE</li><li>Epididymis</li><li>MESA</li><li>PESA</li><li><strong>ART:</strong></li><li><em><strong>IUI</strong></em></li><li>Mild oligo</li><li>Same sex</li><li>Post testicular causes:</li><li>Ejaculatory</li><li>Erectile dysfunction.</li><li><em><strong>IVF</strong></em></li><li>Mild male factor infertility</li><li><em><strong>ICSI</strong></em></li><li>Severe form or failed fertilization in IVF</li><li>33% pregnancy rate</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Favorable Results:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Zinc</li><li>Selenium</li><li>Omega 3 FA</li><li>CO – Q10</li><li>Carotenes</li></ul>
<h3><strong>New developments in Sperm Selection in ART: </strong></h3>
<ul><li>Density gradient configuration</li><li>Swim up</li><li>MESOME:</li><li>Motile sperm organelle morphology evaluation:</li><li>Acrosome</li><li>Post acrosomal stamina</li><li>Neck</li><li>ICSI with morphologically selected sperm injection (IMSI)</li><li>PICSI – physiological ICSI</li><li>HOS – Hypo osmotic swelling</li></ul>', 3) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET content=EXCLUDED.content, type=EXCLUDED.type;
