<ul><li>PID – cogwheel</li><li>Endometriosis – Ground Glass</li><li>Haemorrhagic – Spider web</li><li>Dermoid – Tip of Iceberg/ Dot-dash appearance</li><li>Ectopic – Doughnut/Bagel sign</li><li>OHSS – Spoke wheel</li><li>Mucinous cystadenoma Honey comb</li><li>Torsion – whirl pool</li><li>PCOS – pearly string ovaries</li></ul>', 1) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET content=EXCLUDED.content, type=EXCLUDED.type;
