<h3><strong>Laparoscopy:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>RMI &lt;200.</li><li>Counselling regarding need of staging if suspicion of Malignancy intraoperatively or on histopathology.</li><li>BSO</li><li>Use umbilical port for retrieval of cyst</li></ul>', 3) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET content=EXCLUDED.content, type=EXCLUDED.type;
INSERT INTO topics (id, chapter_id, title, description, "order", is_published, author, source) VALUES ('t-mm-03-005', 'chap-mm-03-01', '5. OVARIAN CYST IN CHILDREN AND ADOLESANTS (TEENS 13 – 15 YEARS)', 'Detailed medical reference and study guide on 5. OVARIAN CYST IN CHILDREN AND ADOLESANTS (TEENS 13 – 15 YEARS).', 5, true, 'Dr. Farzana Muneer', 'Maternal Mind FCPS/MRCOG Textbook') ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET title=EXCLUDED.title, description=EXCLUDED.description, is_published=true;
INSERT INTO content_blocks (id, topic_id, type, content, "order") VALUES ('cb-0f42ac5a', 't-mm-03-005', 'html', '<p><strong>Peak incidence:</strong> 1st year of life or around menarche.</p>
<ul><li>Commonest cause of abdominal cyst in fetus and Neonates. More common in 3rd due to   maternal Estrogen, fetal Gonadotropin, placental HCG.</li></ul>', 1) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET content=EXCLUDED.content, type=EXCLUDED.type;
