<ul><li>Routine due – Defer</li><li>Due for colposcopy.</li><li>Don’t delay: do in late 1st &amp; 2nd trimester</li><li>F/U CIN II &amp; III, positive/ uncertain margins.</li><li>F/U after treatment of CGIN.</li><li>Risk factors of CA cervix.</li><li>F/U after abnormal colposcopy</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Delay until Delivery:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Low Grade dyskaryosis HPV positive.</li><li>F/U after CIN – 1.</li><li>Treated CIN II &amp; III with clear margins.</li></ul>', 3) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET content=EXCLUDED.content, type=EXCLUDED.type;
