<p>2cm below than TVL</p>
<ul><li>11% after prolapse surgery</li><li>1.8% after Non – Prolapse, surgery</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Management:</strong></h3>
<h3><strong>Non – surgical:</strong></h3>
