<h3>Complications:</h3>
<p><strong>Old Frail</strong>- Axis deviation</p>
<ul><li>Lefort to interfere withcolpocleisisintercourse.</li><li>Rectovaginal haematoma.</li><li>Pain</li><li>Bladder Injury.</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Uterosacral</strong><strong> ligament </strong><strong>suspension</strong><strong>:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Risk of uretic injury.</li><li>Cystoscopy is required</li></ul>
<h3><strong>Concomitant incontinence:</strong></h3>
<ul><li>Vault prolapse + incontinence =&gt; treat vault prolapses.</li><li>Anterior wall + SUI =&gt; anterior wall repair.</li><li>Small prolapse + SUI =&gt; correct SUI.</li><li>SUI persist in 1/3rd pts after prolapse surgery.</li></ul>', 1) ON CONFLICT (id) DO UPDATE SET content=EXCLUDED.content, type=EXCLUDED.type;
